1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"phase-7","kind":"phase-index","route":"/roadmap/phase-7","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/phase-7","sourceHash":"517451b9305673213a6c47d1c1468de1e9c90605bbd9651be998d0e3f498de32","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:12:05.717Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"And Beyond","zh":"以及更进一步"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You're fluent. You can live your life in the target language — work, socialize, consume media, navigate the world — without it being a barrier. But fluency isn't the finish line. Phase 7 is where you deepen your mastery, expand your range, and work toward native-level proficiency.","zh":"你已经流利了。你可以用目标语言生活——工作、社交、消费媒体内容、探索世界——而不再受到语言阻碍。但流利并不是终点。第7阶段的重点是深化掌握程度、拓展语言范围，并朝着母语者水平迈进。"}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"This phase is different from everything before it. There are no more bottlenecks to push through, no more dramatic shifts in ability. Instead, it's a long, grueling but rewarding process of becoming more and more at home in the language.","zh":"这一阶段与此前的一切都不同。你不再需要突破瓶颈，能力也不会再出现戏剧性的跃升。相反，这是一个漫长、艰苦但充满回报的过程，让你越来越自在地使用这门语言。"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"You're no longer a learner in the traditional sense — you're a user of the language who happens to be from another country.","zh":"你不再是传统意义上的学习者——你是这门语言的使用者，只是恰好来自另一个国家。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Phase 7 is technically never-ending. The sub-phases here are more like projects than stages — you can do them in order, pick and choose, or revisit them as your goals change. Or just do your own thing! These are just our suggestions for Phase 7.","zh":"第7阶段在技术上永远不会结束。这里的子阶段更像是项目，而不是固定阶段——你可以按顺序完成，也可以自由选择，或随着目标变化反复进行。你也可以做自己的规划！这些只是我们对第7阶段的建议。"}},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Unless you give up on your new language, you'll spend the rest of your life here.","zh":"除非你放弃这门新语言，否则你将在余生都处于这一阶段。"}},{"id":"hour-estimates","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Hour Estimates","zh":"时间估算"}},{"id":"segment-0007","type":"table","rows":[[{"en":"","zh":"","header":true},{"en":"Cousin","zh":"近亲语言","header":true},{"en":"Similar","zh":"相近语言","header":true},{"en":"Neutral","zh":"中性语言","header":true},{"en":"Distant","zh":"差异较大的语言","header":true}],[{"en":"This phase","zh":"本阶段","header":false},{"en":"830","zh":"830","header":false},{"en":"1400","zh":"1400","header":false},{"en":"1860","zh":"1860","header":false},{"en":"2800","zh":"2800","header":false}],[{"en":"Cumulative","zh":"累计","header":false},{"en":"1870","zh":"1870","header":false},{"en":"3150","zh":"3150","header":false},{"en":"4090","zh":"4090","header":false},{"en":"6300","zh":"6300","header":false}]]},{"id":"sub-phases","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Sub-phases","zh":"子阶段"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>7A — Domain Domination:</strong> Become an expert in specific technical or professional domains through focused reading, writing, and discussion.","zh":"<strong>7A——领域精通：</strong>通过专注的阅读、写作和讨论，在特定技术或专业领域成为专家。"}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>7B — Go to School:</strong> Learn the foundational knowledge that native speakers absorb through years of schooling — history, science, geography, literature — entirely in the target language.","zh":"<strong>7B——回到学校：</strong>完全用目标语言学习母语者通过多年学校教育掌握的基础知识——历史、科学、地理、文学等。"}},{"id":"segment-0011","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>7C — Effortlessness:</strong> Remove the last traces of effort from your comprehension and production until the language feels as natural as your native language.","zh":"<strong>7C——毫不费力：</strong>消除理解和表达中最后残留的费力感，直到这门语言像你的母语一样自然。"}},{"id":"segment-0012","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>7D — Going Native:</strong> A lifelong project of closing the final gap between fluent non-native and true native speaker — in vocabulary, cultural knowledge, and depth of connection with the language.","zh":"<strong>7D——融入母语者：</strong>这是一个终身项目，旨在弥合流利的非母语者与真正母语者之间最后的差距——包括词汇、文化知识，以及与这门语言之间的深度连接。"}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>XX (Optional) — Proficiency Testing:</strong> Prepare for and pass a formal language proficiency exam (CEFR, JLPT, HSK, DELE, etc.).","zh":"<strong>XX（可选）——能力测试：</strong>准备并通过正式的语言能力考试（CEFR、JLPT、HSK、DELE等）。"}}],"cards":[{"href":"/roadmap/phase-7/7a-domain-domination","title":{"en":"7ADomain Domination","zh":"7A领域精通"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-7/7b-go-to-school","title":{"en":"7BGo to School","zh":"7B回到学校"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-7/7c-effortlessness","title":{"en":"7CEffortlessness","zh":"7C毫不费力"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-7/7d-going-native","title":{"en":"7DGoing Native","zh":"7D融入母语者"}}]},"siteBasePath":"/my_learning_docs"}]
